  "bio": "Based in the heart of Morehead City, Chrissy Suralik is the proud owner of Inkspiration Studio NC, where cleanliness is paramount, ensuring a safe and sterling environment for all tattoo enthusiasts. With a unique illustrative style, Chrissy combines her passion for art and tattooing to create vivid and detailed masterpieces, maintaining the highest standards of hygiene in every session. Her commitment to cleanliness has earned her a reputation as one of the most trusted tattoo artists in the area.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Morehead City, North Carolina, United States\n\nMom 👦🏼🐶 🐶. Artist mostly. Potter. Tattooer. Owner @inkspirationstudionc  in MHC, NC-est 2010.  \n@theclayacorn is my pottery page 🥰",
